==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~53.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Bore]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Neutralization Type Nimue (Enemy)|Neutralization Type Nimue]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You will need some good crowd control for the Bores such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]]. Otherwise, this level shouldn't be too much of a worry.

